			<div class="content" id="post-content-2681110">
									

<p>Happy Hallowe'en, everyone.</p>
<p>I was happy with my last skip, <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/scp-2559">2559</a>, but it had a very strict, serious tone to fit its content. I wanted to write something softer, more emotional to prove to myself I had that range. I also wanted to write it fast - 2559 took me almost a year of procrastination and 80+ edits before I posted it, and I didn't want that to be a pattern. So I set aside this weekend and told myself I had to post a good article by Hallowe'en. I started with an image that had been stuck in my head for months - a baby owl swaddled in the tight embrace of its dead octopus mother - and worked from there. The format screw came out of necessity - once I'd figured out the story I wanted to tell, it became obvious I'd need to tell it somewhat unconventionally.</p>
<p>Thanks to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/minmin" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(560062); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=560062&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1478687931" alt="minmin" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=560062)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/minmin" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(560062); return false;">minmin</a></span>, <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/agent-macleod" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1922529); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1922529&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1478687931" alt="Agent MacLeod" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1922529)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/agent-macleod" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1922529); return false;">Agent MacLeod</a></span> and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/absentmindednihilist" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2812984); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2812984&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1478687931" alt="AbsentmindedNihilist" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2812984)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/absentmindednihilist" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2812984); return false;">AbsentmindedNihilist</a></span> for crit. Minmin, in particular, really helped me find a shape for this and let me realise it was OK to go for a non-standard format.</p>

							</div>

								
