<p>This skip now has a follow-up tale, <a href="http://www.scp-wiki.net/after-that-until-then">After That/Until Then</a>, written by <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/psul" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2156983); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2156983&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1487351649" alt="psul" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2156983)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/psul" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2156983); return false;">psul</a></span>. It serves as a sequel, but also a sort of reimagining and wrap-up of the events in this article, complementing it really nicely. I consider it canon, and don't intend to ever do my own continuation of Sun-Hee's story, so if you want to see more, it's well worth checking out.</p>

